    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p18::p18_conv_1",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "aa43d4f6078a2e4dfb336e96d9852846bbb930cbbeaee6a770153295c8187614",
      "resource_identity": "9266084547d6359f9a6de905a226e8766fbc2bfa224f22224d710e02ebf8ce21",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Hey, are you there?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hi John, yes, I'm here. How are things going?",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Honestly, things have been a bit tough lately.",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm really sorry to hear that. Do you want to talk about what's been happening?",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Sure, it's my mom. She's been really sick recently, and it's been hard to manage everything.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds incredibly challenging. How has her illness impacted your routine?",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Well, I've been trying to juggle work and taking care of her. It's like there's not enough time in the day.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can imagine that must be overwhelming. Have you been able to get any help with these responsibilities?",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "A little. Some family members have chipped in, but I still feel like I'm carrying most of the load.",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's really important to have support. How are you taking care of yourself in all of this?",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Honestly, I don't think I've been taking care of myself as much as I should. I'm just exhausted.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's understandable to feel that way. Finding a bit of time for yourself could help, even if it's just small breaks.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah, I guess I need to be better about that. It's just hard to let myself relax when there's so much to do.",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's tough to prioritize yourself, but remember your well-being matters too. Maybe there's a small activity you enjoy that could give you some peace.",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I used to enjoy going for walks. Maybe I could start doing that again.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds like a wonderful idea. A little fresh air and movement can be refreshing.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thanks, I'll try to make time for it. I just want to be there for my mom as much as I can.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "The love and care you’re giving her is invaluable. It’s clear how much she means to you.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "She does. It's difficult to see her like this, but I'm trying my best.",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Your effort and dedication are really admirable, John. It's okay to acknowledge the difficulty and seek help when you need it.",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thanks for saying that. I often worry if I'm doing enough.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Your dedication is clear, and you're definitely doing a lot. Remember, it’s okay to lean on others and share the burden.",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I suppose you're right. I might talk to my siblings about splitting the responsibilities more evenly.",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds like a constructive step. Having a supportive team can make a big difference.",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah, I’ll reach out to them. Thanks for listening and helping me process everything.",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Anytime, John. I'm here whenever you need to talk. Take care of yourself and let me know how things go.",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I will. Thanks again, you're a big help.",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-11-05",
          "session_id": "p18_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You're very welcome. Talk soon!",
          "turn_index": 27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p18::esc1252",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "d82ee55e4bea7893e98691af56de0a3d3bb767628466709f724538ae3c38e952",
      "resource_identity": "7790f065c477973d2375c79f8e2641cd2552f123ed21d6673259e8703195dd47",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hi! Hope you are doing well?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Hi, yes am doing well",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Glad to know that you are doing well. How may I assist you today ?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I had a drinking challenge which has been affecting my marriage for quit sometime now",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "So as far as I understand that you had issues with your wife due to your drinking. Am I right?",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes that is true",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That is really a serious problem. I know it must be very tough time for you. Hope you are trying your best to save your marriage.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes I have really reduced my drinking to ensure I save my marriage",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That's is a great initiative. I know it is tough for you but not impossible. I can feel how hard you are trying t save your relationship. I appreciate you for that.",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you for the encouragement. Will do everything I can to save the situation",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Family comes first. I would do anything to save my marriage as you are doing. I am proud of you. I am pretty sure you both love each other more than anything.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes my wife is everything to me and can not imagine loosing her due to some avoidable reasons",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That should be the spirit. Now nothing can make you apart. Drinking is very easy for you to quit now. you will definitely get a success.",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "No problem! That's why I am here to help you. Have a wonderful life ahead!",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Any other general advice you may have for me",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Just stick to the plan. Spend more time together. Cook dinner for her. Make a strong bond and my best wishes are there for you .",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Wow that is some wonderful advice right there. thank you for that..Any other tips to spice things up",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You both can go for a date or do the things what your partner like. Drinking is luring so stay away from that and you can do it.",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you I will definitely avoid drinking and any thing else that may contribute to such kind of issues",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It seems you got the solution. have a wonderful time.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you for the assistance. Really appreciates",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-10-01",
          "session_id": "esc1252",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "your most welcome!",
          "turn_index": 22
        }
      ]
