          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "i feel upset today",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm so sorry to hear that. Is there any particular reason you feel upset today?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes.i have sleeping problem",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That's really hard, but I'm sure we can find a way to make your sleeping more at ease. Has it been happening frequently? ",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes.the problem occurs me daily night",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I had a problem sleeping before, is it ok if I give you some suggestions that helped me and might help you too?",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes.sure i am ready to get suggetions from you",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Try practicing meditation and yoga, and avoid mobile phones atleast an hour before you sleep. Chamomile tea also helped me relaxed before. ",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "ok.its very good advice .i will follow these steps surely",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That's wonderful that you're very open, I'm sure you will be well in no time. If you still have a hard time sleeping, feel free to contact us again. We'll be happy to help.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "ya.sure.thanks you very much for the help",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You're welcome! Have a nice day.",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "thank you so much .have a nice day",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Stay safe and try doing naps first.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "i decided to to yoga for better sleep",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc982",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "that's wonderful. how did it go?",
